## Factor tables and documents

The factor tables in `inst/extdata/` and `data/` (effects, adjustments,
pathways, baseline disease, baseline exposure, schema) and the report template
are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence
(CC BY 4.0), <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/>. Source data keep
their own terms: WHO Global Health Observatory (open use with attribution), DHS
indicator data (aggregates, citation required), JMP data via the openwashdata
jmpdata package (CC BY 4.0), WHO 2023 burden report (values cited).
